Package: oote
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign unified theming engine for openOODA
 oote is the sovereign unified theming and color styling engine for the
 openOODA ecosystem. It provides 25 seasonal and monthly themes, dual
 light/dark modes, custom border styles, expressive ASCII mascots,
 and a streaming Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
